    "detail": {
      "id": 1350221,
      "name": "[Nangong Yu] Focus Shift",
      "desc": "When other squad members trigger <color=#FFFFFF>Disorder</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color>, Nangong Yu will launch a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> around the target enemy. This attack is an <color=#FFFFFF>Aftershock</color>. This effect can trigger at most once every 6s. When Nangong Yu's <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> heavy attack hits a target afflicted with <color=#FE437E>Ether Anomaly</color>, <color=#2EB6FF>Electric Anomaly</color>, <color=#FF5521>Fire Anomaly</color>, <color=#F0D12B>Physical Anomaly</color>, <color=#98EFF0>Ice Anomaly</color>, or <color=#A6C5FD>Wind Anomaly</color> it triggers <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color> once, which deals additional Attribute Anomaly DMG equal to <color=#FE437E>230%</color>/<color=#2EB6FF>120%</color>/<color=#FF5521>300%</color>/<color=#F0D12B>20%</color>/<color=#98EFF0>30%</color>/<color=#A6C5FD>12%</color> of the original Attribute Anomaly DMG. This effect can trigger once every 6s.",
